{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35234","headline":"苔歌 · 顾云","name":"苔歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"槛前溪夺秋空色，百丈潭心数砂砾。\n松筠条条长碧苔，苔色碧於溪水碧。\n波回梳开孔雀尾，根细贴着盘陀石。\n拨浪轻拈出少时，一髻浓烟三四尺。\n山光日华乱相射，静缕兰鬐匀襞积。\n试把临流抖擞看，琉璃珠子泪双滴。\n如看玉女洗头处，解破云鬟收未得。\n即是仙宫欲制六铢衣，染丝未倩鲛人织。\n采之不敢盈筐箧，苦怕龙神河伯惜。\n琼苏玉盐烂漫煮，咽入丹田续灵液。\n会待功成插翅飞，蓬莱顶上寻仙客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}